WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.856
Water splashed.

2
00:00:05.857 --> 00:00:09.347
"Yay!" Dipper cheered.

3
00:00:09.348 --> 00:00:12.054
Gasser drove through the water again.

4
00:00:12.055 --> 00:00:15.998
Splash!

5
00:00:15.999 --> 00:00:20.692
"Do it again, Gasser!" Poppy said.

6
00:00:20.693 --> 00:00:23.918
Just then Ms. Fender drove over.

7
00:00:23.919 --> 00:00:26.375
"Gasser," she said.

8
00:00:26.376 --> 00:00:29.535
"Stop that right now!"

9
00:00:29.536 --> 00:00:31.765
Gasser frowned.

10
00:00:31.766 --> 00:00:34.455
"Sorry," he said.

11
00:00:34.456 --> 00:00:38.268
"Just play in the sand," Ms. Fender said.

12
00:00:38.269 --> 00:00:49.488
"Water is not for cars!"

13
00:00:49.489 --> 00:00:53.569
Ms. Fender drove off.

14
00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:58.159
Gasser waited for a moment.

15
00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:01.763
"Ms. Fender is gone," he said.

16
00:01:01.764 --> 00:01:04.390
Brumm, brumm!

17
00:01:04.391 --> 00:01:07.255
Gasser sped through the water again.

18
00:01:07.256 --> 00:01:12.772
Everyone laughed.

19
00:01:12.773 --> 00:01:18.108
"The water feels great," Dipper said.

20
00:01:18.109 --> 00:01:20.711
"I'm going in!"

21
00:01:20.712 --> 00:01:23.494
"No, Dipper!" Eddy said.

22
00:01:23.495 --> 00:01:26.506
"It's fine," Dipper said.

23
00:01:26.507 --> 00:01:30.813
Dipper drove into the water.

24
00:01:30.814 --> 00:01:42.860
She went in deeper and deeper.

25
00:01:42.861 --> 00:01:45.422
Dipper called to her friends.

26
00:01:45.423 --> 00:01:57.164
"Come on in!" she said.

